{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/772561-changing-your-hunger","id":772561,"title":"Changing your Hunger","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-23T15:31:16-08:00","id":772561,"title":"Changing your Hunger","content":"The book is explicit that you cannot change your Family. In the next section, it entirely omits any stance on whether or not your hunger can be changed after play starts.<br /> <br /> Is it possible? If so, how? If not, why?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T16:07:23-08:00","id":772591,"title":"","content":"Good question. I was actually intending to ask the same thing. It seems reasonable to me that it might be changed over time. Perhaps by acquiring a taste for another type of act that produces 'the shock' in a victim?<br /> <br /> I've got a related question, though: Can a Beast with one hunger can satiety by feeding a different one? e.g.: if I have a hunger for prey, is there anything stopping me from feeding by starting a dragon's hoard of things that other people value?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":8950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","user":"Vithrir","date":". 11-23-2015, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-23T19:41:59-08:00","id":772738,"title":"","content":"I would assume no, your Hunger is a part of you that can't be changed short of something major happening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T11:52:14-08:00","id":773291,"title":"","content":"I would agree. The hunger is part of what that particular horror is. I wouldn't think you could go around just changing that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5610-aslan751","name":"aslan751","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5610_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T13:17:52-08:00","id":773370,"title":"","content":"The specific reason why I think that it might be reasonable for a Beast to change its Hunger is that the thing they are feeding on isn't having a hoard or eating people or whatever it is that they feed on; it's a thing very nebulously defined as 'the shock,' which seems to be something that affects the victim's soul in some way, and which can but doesn't necessarily have to cause an Integrity breaking point. The victim's response to the Beast impacts the Primordial Dream in some way, and the Horror draws sustenance from this. As long as they can produce this 'shock,' I don't see any reason why a Horror's tastes couldn't change over time. Similar to how something that's your favorite food when you were seven may not be something you even like anymore when you are an adult.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T13:22:51-08:00","id":773374,"title":"","content":"Question. How specific a change are you talking? Like are you asking if we can change from collector to predator, or do you just mean like going from collector of fine art to a collector of rare texts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T13:45:02-08:00","id":773394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/772561-changing-your-hunger?p=773374#post773374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question. How specific a change are you talking? Like are you asking if we can change from collector to predator, or do you just mean like going from collector of fine art to a collector of rare texts?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a character in one of my games that started out as a Collector, but due to events in the story, found himself in the roll of a Nemesis - which we all found resonated much more thoroughly with his overall character concept.<br /> <br /> We allowed the Hunger to change pretty much without question, since the unspoken implication is that they can change. But I feel like there should have been some sort of mechanical gravity to the decision, and not just narrative satisfaction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T22:51:02-08:00","id":773665,"title":"","content":"So II'll need to look to see if there's any mechanical backing later in the book, but I found this:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong> Beast pg 15</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> It is rare for a Beast\u2019s Hunger to change, though it can happen in certain extreme circumstances and always signals a profound struggle to reconcile with the Horror.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T23:34:05-08:00","id":773683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/772561-changing-your-hunger?p=773665#post773665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So II'll need to look to see if there's any mechanical backing later in the book, but I found this:</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if it doesn't provide any kind of mechanical resolution, this is definitely a huge help for us. Good find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T05:53:12-08:00","id":775419,"title":"","content":"I asked Blackhat Matt about it in the RPGNet thread when that was going, and he said it's possible but very rare.<br /> <br /> I think it would make sense - though he didn't say this - that it wouldn't be a conscious decision on the part of the Beast (or her Horror).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T05:59:57-08:00","id":775420,"title":"","content":"I could see the hunger changing as your character evolves. For example my Kraken starts out punishing his fellow students at school for bullying others as he moves on in life he begins to branch out slowly over time he moves from bullying to feeding on the intolerant following the Neo-Nazi and White Supremacist groups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}